Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Sitemap|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|sitePagePrivacy|Private|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	Then Page add Child
		|page|Private Pages|
		|pageName|Site Page Name|
		|siteChildPageName|Child Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: Display Private Page With Child Page
Priority: 4
	Given Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Site Map|
	When Portlet view Specific PG
		|portletName|Site Map|
	Then SiteMapPortlet view Default PG
		|listChildPageName|Child Page Name|
		|listPageName|Site Page Name|